he inverse of the probability of the school's selection into the study\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"no statistically significant differences (p>0.05) by sex were observed for soccer and basketball.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}